# Runtime development rules

When editing files under `runtime/`, read and follow [`runtime/AGENTS.md`](../../runtime/AGENTS.md).

It covers `internal/shared` boundaries, httpserver/logging/redact usage, HTTP error handling for the loopback UI, CSS token usage, composer alignment, form patterns, and common mistakes from prior bugs.

Consider these rules if they affect your changes.
